{
  "$note": "Golden plans for the v2 query grammar, read by tests/Feature/Ai/GoldenPlanTest.php and by nothing else. `plan` is what a planner emits; `expect` is the NORMALISED plan PlanValidator must return for it, asserted key by key. A refused case carries the `names` its refusal must contain - a refusal that does not say which word was wrong is a dead end - and the `category` is which of the two legitimate buckets it falls in. No model is called: this fixture tests the layer's contract with no vendor in the loop. See docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-24-ai-mode-grammar-v2.md.",
